      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lysolaje_(Prague)"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "From the 16th century, the village became a notable wine‑making area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lysolaje_(Prague)"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Today Lysolaje forms part of a wildlife corridor on the edge of Prague.",
