        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lysolaje_(Prague)"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Author Eliška Krásnohorská lived in Lysolaje between 1862 and 1867.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lysolaje_(Prague)"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Lysolaje borders Suchdol to the north, Sedlec to the east, Dejvice to the south, and Horoměřice to the west.",
